  "description": "Zopfli compression in pure C#, with no native dependencies at all. A faithful port of Google's Zopfli: deflate, zlib and gzip output byte-for-byte identical to the C library, typically 3-8% smaller than zlib at its best level, readable by any standard decoder. Thread-safe, trimming and NativeAOT safe.",
